    "title": "Rockdale is getting a brand-new mictrotransit service - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KWKT Staff ,\n5 hours ago\nROCKDALE, Texas ( FOX 44 ) – A reliable and affordable way to get around is coming to Rockdale on October 1st!\nThe HOP, a regional public transit system in Central Texas, is launching a brand-new mictrotransit service in the area. You can find out more in our interview above.\nAccording to the Hill Country Transit District (HCTD), this will expand mobility options and provide additional service to residents alongside the existing demand response service available throughout Milam County. Residents will have access to this flexible, on-demand service allowing riders to schedule trips in real-time or in advance.\nFor more information about the new Rockdale microtransit service, including details on how to\nbook a ride, you can go here .\n(Courtesy: Hill Country Transit District) (Courtesy: Hill Country Transit District) Copyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KWKT - FOX 44.",
